            <div class="feedback-grid">
                <div class="feedback-card">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-face-smile"></i> Positive Feedback</h3>
                    <p>Students appreciated the faster booking confirmation and the improved facility cleanliness.</p>
                    <small>Last updated: Oct 22, 2025</small>
                </div>

                <div class="feedback-card">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-face-frown"></i> Negative Feedback</h3>
                    <p>Some users mentioned that the app sometimes lags when loading facility details.</p>
                    <small>Last updated: Oct 21, 2025</small>
                </div>

                <div class="feedback-card">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Suggestions</h3>
                    <p>Students recommended adding push notifications and a dark mode for better accessibility.</p>
                    <small>Last updated: Oct 20, 2025</small>
                </div>

                <div class="feedback-card">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i> Insights</h3>
                    <p>Overall satisfaction increased by 25% this month, especially among frequent facility users.</p>
                    <small>Last updated: Oct 22, 2025</small>
                </div>
            </div>

